            "id": "ann_1",
            "type": "note",
            "text": "WebRenderTOP — Data Visualization\n\nA scrolling multi-channel waveform display rendered\nin the browser via Canvas 2D. The JS param pushes\nnew data points each cook frame.\n\nPattern: Define a window.gonodesPush() function in\nthe HTML, then call it from the 'javascript' param\nto bridge GONODES data into the browser.\n\nUse expressions on the JS param to pass live\nCHOP/parameter values into the visualization.",
